<heading>logout - End the current session identity.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  logout
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Clears the session identity (user). The session returns to an
unauthenticated state; permission checks no longer see a user.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
su
</paragraph>
